What:           /sys/bus/platform/devices/*/soc_state
Date:           October 2026
Description:
                Read-only QGauge estimator diagnostics. Space-separated key=value
                fields describe whether the FIFO estimator is enabled, whether a
                hardware OCV/full-charge anchor has been obtained, and whether
                an unresolved measurement gap exists. Capture counters and
                sampled/elapsed durations expose measurement coverage. Charge
                values are microamp-hours; OCV is microvolts; time is milliseconds.
                A boot-time terminal-voltage seed is provisional. Neither this
                attribute nor CHARGE_NOW establishes measured battery health.
